OL,3,GNEWSAAppetite for financial aid to
OL,4,AUkraine 'dwindling'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe public's appetite for supplying
OL,7,Ffinancial aid to Ukraine has dwindled,
OL,8,Fa man whose organisation has donated 50
OL,9,Fvehicles to the country's war effort
OL,10,Fsays.
OL,12,FGraeme Reavley, from Bowsden,
OL,13,FNorthumberland, has made 21 trips to
OL,14,Fthe Eastern European nation since
OL,15,FRussia's invasion in 2022, delivering a
OL,16,Fvehicle each time.
OL,18,FHe said: "It's now dragged on for four
OL,19,Fyears, the war. There are a lot of
OL,20,Fother issues in the world requiring
OL,21,Fpeople's support."
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
