OL,3,GNEWSAAppetite for financial aid to
OL,4,AUkraine 'dwindling'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUniversity of Sunderland paramedic
OL,7,Fscience lecturer Kate Snowdon delivered
OL,8,Fa car and medical aid to Lviv in
OL,9,FOctober and echoed Reavley's thoughts.
OL,10,F"There's a real concern that everyday
OL,11,Fpeople are going to be forgotten in all
OL,12,Fof this," she said.
